       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PAYROLL.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT EMP-FILE ASSIGN TO "EMP.DAT".
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD EMP-FILE.
       01 EMP-RECORD.
           05 EMP-ID PIC 9(5).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-TOTAL PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-RATE PIC 9(3) VALUE 10.
       01 WS-EMPLOYEE.
           05 WS-NAME PIC X(20).
           05 WS-HOURS PIC 9(3).
       01 WS-STATUS PIC X.
           88 WS-DONE VALUE "Y".
       77 WS-COUNT PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-SECTION SECTION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM CALC-PARA.
           CALL "TAXCALC" USING WS-TOTAL.
           DISPLAY WS-TOTAL.
           STOP RUN.
       CALC-PARA.
           COMPUTE WS-TOTAL = WS-RATE * 40.
